      "file_path": "packages/core/src/safe-git.ts",
      "line_number": 10,
      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Callers still treat the safeGit result as a string",
      "description": "safeGit now returns a GitResult object, but currentBranch in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 still calls name.trim() on it. changedFiles in packages/cli/src/status.ts:7 still calls out.split() on it. currentBranch catches the TypeError and always returns null, so the CLI always exits with 'not a git repository'. In changedFiles, the TypeError is not caught, so it rejects. Update currentBranch and changedFiles to read result.stdout. Have them check result.code, since safeGit no longer throws.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "lens:return-shape-contract-break",
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "safeGit now returns a GitResult object, but currentBranch in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 still calls name.trim() on it. changedFiles in packages/cli/src/status.ts:7 still calls out.split() on it.",
      "consequence": "currentBranch catches the TypeError and always returns null, so the CLI always exits with 'not a git repository'. In changedFiles, the TypeError is not caught, so it rejects.",
      "fix": "Update currentBranch and changedFiles to read result.stdout. Have them check result.code, since safeGit no longer throws."
    },
    {
      "origin": "agent",
      "severity": "major",
      "category": "bug",
      "confidence": 0.85,
      "file_path": "packages/core/src/safe-git.ts",
      "line_number": 14,
      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Failure signal moved from a thrown error to a return code",
      "description": "currentBranch relies on safeGit throwing to detect a missing repository. safeGit now catches every failure and returns a nonzero code instead. Outside a repository, currentBranch's catch never runs, so currentBranch cannot return null for that case. The CLI then reports failed git output as a branch name instead of exiting. Make currentBranch return null when result.code is nonzero. Make changedFiles handle a nonzero result.code too.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": null,
